OL,3,AYoung people describe 'unbearable' wait
OL,4,Atimes after review of mental ill
OL,5,Ahealth, ADHD and autism support
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe noted how conditions such as anxiety
OL,8,Fand depression can "worsen the traits
OL,9,Fof ADHD and autism" - BBC Verify looks
OL,10,Fat the rising number of diagnoses for
OL,11,Fboth disorders
OL,13,FJasmine, 23, tells us her five-year
OL,14,Fwait for an ADHD assessment has been
OL,15,F"unbearable" while Christine says "the
OL,16,Fsystem is failing" her seven-year-old
OL,17,Fgrandson - read more about others'
OL,18,Fexperiences
